<h1 nodeId="459f7fd7-6246-4703-bd2e-0483fbd23a12">1 核心概要 Executive Summary (Aug 2026)</h1>
<p nodeId="c09f0990-4e72-4155-b9c4-a366efe796cf">8月全月收官总结聚焦两项：①KRI层面，团队综合系数均值<strong>1.1050</strong>（7月0.8391，+31.7%），12名BDM全部≥0.97。全月新签<strong>240家</strong>（Top 159 + Mid 62 + MH 19），NS系数均值1.629；CI系数均值1.342，7/12人达1.5最高档，作为8月最大权重(35%)成为系数跃升核心引擎；营业率均值93.9%（7月95.7%，-1.8pp），未达95%目标；订单是唯一全员无突破的维度——12/12人停在0.8档，全月总单量1,839,798单，达成率82.6%。Management Score（10%）待CM评定。②订单渗透激励赛(7/27-8/31)收官：BD达标20/71（WS 17 + Santos 3），BDM达标2/12（igorfeitosa 19.8、adriananaves 17.38），wanessasilva以60分夺冠。8月管理主线：新签+CI双引擎驱动团队系数大幅上扬，9月须补营业率与订单两块短板。</p>
<p nodeId="ccad8353-0c7e-4b9f-b211-09a211549888"><em>August closed with two focal results: (1) KRI — team average coefficient 1.1050 (vs Jul 0.8391, +31.7%), all 12 BDMs at 0.97+. Full-month new signs 240 (Top 159 + Mid 62 + MH 19), NS avg 1.629; CI avg 1.342 with 7/12 at the top 1.5 band — CI (35%, biggest weight) was the core engine. Op rate averaged 93.9% (vs Jul 95.7%, -1.8pp), below the 95% target. Orders was the only dimension with zero breakthrough: all 12 stuck at 0.8, total 1,839,798 orders, 82.6% achievement. Management Score pending CM evaluation. (2) Order Penetration Campaign (Jul 27–Aug 31) closed: BD qualification 20/71 (WS 17 + Santos 3), BDM 2/12 (igorfeitosa 19.8, adriananaves 17.38); wanessasilva champion at 60 pts. Aug management takeaway: NS+CI dual engines drove the surge; Sep must fix op rate and orders.</em></p>
