<h2 nodeId="77a422bd-e9e8-40be-bd34-ad68b190670a">4.4 正面防御案例与机会 Positive Defense &amp; Opportunities</h2>
<ul nodeId="c87a239f-c425-4eb1-aaf7-9b0c1fba6b51">
<li nodeId="d6ee8115-2b70-4128-8117-bb80b4413610"><strong>BAETA GRILL（Southern）</strong>：yellow巴西已接受KP反提案，等中国总部审批——最接近保住的高金额客户。 <em>BAETA GRILL (Southern): 99 Brazil accepted the KP counter-proposal, pending China HQ approval — closest to being saved.</em></li>
<li nodeId="0480271c-0020-47b3-bb96-100c15eb7b64"><strong>Rei dos Combos / JM lanches（Southern）</strong>：99两轮抬价（5万→18万雷亚尔）均被拒，KP反报价35万雷亚尔待yellow回应——以价换时间的空间仍在。 <em>Rei dos Combos / JM lanches (Southern): both 99 bids (50K then 180K BRL) rejected; KP counter at 350K BRL pending — room to trade price for time.</em></li>
<li nodeId="5865ff6a-72a4-4f9a-a817-e08ef1dec643"><strong>Espeto Japa（Western）</strong>：99报价40万雷亚尔但含双平台排他、BD评估未含GMV保障条款，客户仍在犹豫。 <em>Espeto Japa (Western): 99 offered 400K BRL with dual-platform exclusivity but no GMV guarantee; the client is still hesitant.</em></li>
</ul>
<p nodeId="10c7ab92-c581-4d0c-960b-e3c16c1f9880"><strong>管理结论</strong>：99打法=现金upfront+长期排他+口头承诺组合，Santos出现iFood两店打包（80万雷亚尔）新威胁形态。Western风险最重（6家中2家已流失+2家高危），防守重心应立即前移到5家即将签约客户，尤其是Thunder Lanches（200万雷亚尔）和Santos两店打包。</p>
<p nodeId="fe3855f5-d46e-4105-bf0d-5cbc3dff7a53"><em>Management takeaway: 99's playbook = cash upfront + long-term exclusivity + verbal promises; Santos now sees an iFood two-store bundle (800K BRL) as a new threat vector. Western carries the heaviest risk (2 lost + 2 critical of 6). Defense must shift immediately to the 5 near-signing merchants — above all Thunder Lanches (2M BRL) and the Santos bundle.</em></p>
